                "text": "The warnings about Trump & Republicans\u2019 Big Ugly Law were not fear-mongering or scare tactics. And now they are a new reality.\n\nHere\u2019s more confirmation on local shockwaves to our health system.\n\nLearn how Rhode Islanders will lose access to Medicaid coverage or see insurance premiums increase by an average of 85%: https://t.co/KDJmKluQCJ",
